{"id":"f8ce53d1-ba9c-4bc0-b078-19eec4191267","title":"安达卢西亚的余辉：科尔多瓦大清真寺","excerpt":"一座横跨八个世纪的建筑，见证了穆斯林、基督徒与犹太人的相遇。","cover_image":"","cover_focal_y":50,"excerpt_enabled":false,"is_pinned":false,"is_featured":false,"view_count":280,"like_count":22,"comment_count":0,"published_at":"2026-04-12T09:39:34.885973+00:00","updated_at":"2026-06-10T16:40:22.498807+00:00","video_url":"","author":{"id":"be72bef2-eb4f-40a3-9cf3-673a14cfa3da","username":"22ww","avatar_url":"https://kbnkixakgfaejakqlqtt.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/be72bef2-eb4f-40a3-9cf3-673a14cfa3da/1776865544845.jpg","role":"admin","badge_text":""},"category":{"id":"481f6dc4-ac83-4b43-b373-27f4e2f30688","slug":"culture","name":"伊斯兰文化"},"content":"十世纪的科尔多瓦，曾是当时欧洲最璀璨的城市之一。街灯点亮夜色，书馆藏书四十万卷。\n\n大清真寺（La Mezquita）是这座城市的象征。层层红白相间的马蹄拱，向前延伸，仿佛无尽的棕榈林。\n\n今天，它既是教堂也是历史遗迹，每一块石头都在低声诉说——文明最动人的时刻，往往发生在彼此包容的年代。","author_id":"be72bef2-eb4f-40a3-9cf3-673a14cfa3da","category_id":"481f6dc4-ac83-4b43-b373-27f4e2f30688","status":"published","created_at":"2026-04-19T09:39:34.885973+00:00"}